OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785156513
OL,3,CPolice investigating haystack in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as 'suspected arson'
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a haystack
OL,7,Ffire in Nottingham as "suspected
OL,8,Farson."
OL,10,FIt's after crews from Nottinghamshire
OL,11,FFire and Rescue Service (NFRS) were
OL,12,Fcalled to a large haystack fire in a
OL,13,Ffield near Saxondale Island yesterday
OL,14,Fevening (July 24).
OL,16,FThe huge inferno, which fire crews
OL,17,Ftackled throughout the night, involved
OL,18,Faround 1,200 bales of hay.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
