OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1785156513
OL,3,CPolice investigating haystack in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as 'suspected arson'
OL,6,FThe fire service say the fire was
OL,7,Fbrought under control by this morning
OL,8,F(July 25), but that one fire engine
OL,9,Fremains at the site to monitor and
OL,10,Fextinguish the fire safely.
OL,12,FA spokesperson from Nottinghamshire
OL,13,FPolice said: "Nottinghamshire Police
OL,14,Fis currently investigating the
OL,15,Fincident as suspected arson.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
