OL,3,CPolice investigating haystack in
OL,4,CNottinghamshire as 'suspected arson'
OL,6,F"If you were in the area of the Fosse
OL,7,FWay between Cropwell Butler and
OL,8,FSaxondale Island, near Bingham, and
OL,9,Fhave any information that may assist
OL,10,Fthe investigation, please contact
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police on 101 and
OL,12,Fquote incident reference
OL,13,F0716 24072026."
